# CR-B3-02: the fixture PNGs under proof/fixture/ are FUNCTIONAL film-data
# inputs (caption strips, plates, calendar/sign plates) — the binary reads
# them at render time. Re-include them against the repo-root *.png rule.
# Rendered outputs are never written under proof/ (the workflow renders
# into RUNNER_TEMP), so this cannot re-admit rendered evidence.
!**/*.png
